      "verification": "17 synthetic tests, including bounded solution checked with SciPy BVLS, full jointfit independently audited by normal equations/KKT, complete future/current record perturbation invariance, missing prefix, sourcefallback and originalriskfloor. Fullrun allmeta minima, all199jointcalibrationfits and date multiplicities, issued actions and8 independentcapitalbooks. Source v35 exact4CSV outputs.104independent summary assertions and actual failed-case CLI guard.",
